</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td nowrap>
<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2005/08/23 (火) 23:50:23 <strong>▽</strong> 日本海 </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs.cgi?res=200508232235023&log=takurou">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200508232235023"></font>
</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=16 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td>
